---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service | PRESSUREPOINT" description="PRESSUREPOINT terms of service for website use and product inquiries.">
  <section class="bg-navy-950 text-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">Terms of Service</h1>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 prose prose-slate">
      <h2>Website Use</h2>
      <p>By using this website you agree to use the information provided for legitimate business purposes only. Product specifications are subject to change without notice.</p>
      <h2>Product Information</h2>
      <p>Product descriptions and specifications on this website are provided in good faith. Final specifications, ratings and performance are confirmed in the quotation and order documentation.</p>
      <h2>Quotations and Orders</h2>
      <p>All quotations are valid for 30 days unless stated otherwise. Orders are subject to our standard sales terms confirmed in the quotation.</p>
      <h2>Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>All content on this website, including text and graphics, is the property of PRESSUREPOINT and may not be reproduced without permission.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms: cj226144@gmail.com.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
